WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Red Points: 6 cards each, 4 on the table.
You are East; capture the most red-card points.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:19.099 line:0
After your card, one more is flipped. A–9 pair to
make 10; 10–K pair with the same rank.

00:00:19.099 --> 00:00:21.999 line:0
East plays ♦Q and captures the ♣Q.
You must capture when you can.

00:00:21.999 --> 00:00:29.998 line:0
Fast-forward: each turn plays one card and flips
one; with no match, the card stays on the table.

00:00:29.998 --> 00:00:38.748 line:0
East plays ♥10 and captures the ♠10.

00:00:38.748 --> 00:00:43.998 line:0
The flipped ♥2 matches several 8s to make 10:
click the highlighted ♣8 to capture it.

00:00:43.998 --> 00:00:54.998 line:0
Fast-forward through the stock and hands.
Only captured hearts and diamonds score.

00:00:54.998 --> 00:01:04.000 line:0
West wins with 89 points;
North, East and South score 31, 38 and 50.
